-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",242,{
[7713]="7005298B\n1\tCollect grapes (total: 8)\tThe vineyard can be found west of the Beorninghús. You should gather some grapes for making jam.\n2\tPlace the grapes into the tub at the Beorninghús\tThe grape tub can be found at the Beorninghús. You should place the grapes that you have collected into the tub.\n3\tWash your feet in the wash bucket\tThe wash bucket can be found at the Beorninghús. You should wash your feet before stomping on grapes.\n4\tCrush the grapes by doing a dance on them\030Stand in the tub\tThe grape tub can be found at the Beorninghús. You should stomp on the grapes.\n5\tCollect the crushed grapes from the tub\tThe grape tub can be found at the Beorninghús. You should remove the crushed grapes from the tub.\n6\tAdd the crushed grapes to a half-empty honey jar\tA honey jar can be found at the Beorninghús. You should add the crushed grapes to the jar.\n7\tGive the jar a good shake\tYou should shake the jar.\n8\tBring the jam to Gírta\tGírta can be found at the Beorninghús. You should bring the jam to Gírta.\n",
[7714]="70035F41\n1\tHear Gárferth's thoughts\030Hear Edsig's thoughts\030Hear Cyneberg's thoughts\tGárferth, Edsig, and Cyneberg are in the Mead Hall at Forlaw. You should speak with Gárferth, Edsig, and Cyneberg to hear what they think should be done about Núrzum.\n2\tSpeak with Gárwig\tGárwig is in the Mead Hall of Forlaw. You should speak with Gárwig.\n3\tTalk to Gárferth\030Speak with Edsig\tGárferth and Edsig are in the Mead Hall at Forlaw. You should speak with Gárferth and Edsig.\n4\tSpeak with Gárwig\tGárwig is in the Mead Hall of Forlaw. You should speak with Gárwig.\n",
[7715]="70062DE5\n1\tDefeat Orcs in Tharbad and retrieve any items of value ([see journal]/6)\tThe Orcs that prowl within the flooded city of Tharbad might have found items of value.\n2\tDefeat Orcs in Tharbad and retrieve any items of value (5/6)\tThe Orcs that prowl within the flooded city of Tharbad might have found items of value.\n3\tBring the old insignia to Caron west of Tharbad\tCaron is west of Tharbad, on the river-bank.\n",
[7716]="7006BF76\n1\tRecover Usakâr's favourite walking stick from a marsh-strider in Zahûmakh\tRecover Usakâr's favourite walking stick from a marsh-strider in Zahûmakh.\n2\tRecover Usakâr's favourite walking stick from a marsh-strider in Zahûmakh\tRecover Usakâr's favourite walking stick from a marsh-strider in Zahûmakh.\n3\tReturn to Usakâr near Dag Usakâra with the walking stick\tReturn to Usakâr near Dag Usakâra with the walking stick.\n",
[7717]="7005AABB\n1\tDefeat hobgoblins in the Pit of Stonejaws (total: 10)\tScout-master Ausma has asked you to defeat any hobgoblins you come across while looking for Shakhajât. You should defeat hobgoblins in the Pit of Stonejaws.\n2\tTalk to Scout-master Ausma at Bárgstad\tYou have defeated many hobgoblins in the Pit of Stonejaws. You should talk to Scout-master Ausma at Bárgstad.\n",
[7718]="70030D41\n1\tMeet Fastred in the prison of Snowbourn\tFastred is in the prison of Snowbourn, located near the Mead Hall. Fastred wants you to meet with him so that he can right his recent wrongs.\n2\tTalk to Fastred in the prison of Snowbourn\tFastred has told you to meet him in the prison of Snowbourn, located near the Mead Hall. You should speak with Fastred, as he instructed.\n3\tRelease Gísling from his cell\tGísling's cell is inside the prison of Snowbourn. You should open Gísling's cell and return to him his freedom now that Sigeric has been exposed as a traitor.\n4\tTalk to Gísling in Snowbourn\tGísling can be found in eastern Snowbourn to the north of the east gate. You should speak with Gísling now that he has been freed from his imprisonment.\n",
[7719]="700217A8\n1\tCollect swamp-gas from Rushock Bog (total: 5)\030Collect a raw rotten egg from Sandson's Farm\030Collect slime from slimy slugs near Celondim (total: 7)\tJónar's ingredients can be collected in the following places: swamp-gas can be found in the Rushock Bog. Raw egg can be found at Sandson's farm. Slimy slug-slime can be found along the river's edge near Celondim. You should collect swamp-gas, raw egg, and slug-slime for Jónar's special brew.\n2\tBring the disgusting ingredients to Jónar\tJónar is in the cellar of Thorin's Hall. You should bring Jónar all of the disgusting ingredients you collected during your adventure.\n",
[7720]="700217ED\n1\tDeliver Jónar's special brew to the Party Tree\tThe Party Tree is in the Shire, in the town of Hobbiton. You should deliver Jónar's special brew to the Party Tree, where it will surely ruin the day of many hobbits who have gathered there. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tUse Jónar's Special Brew on the Shire festival patrons\tThe Party Tree is in Hobbiton, in the Shire. You should set off Jónar's horrible brew around the gathering of Shire Festival Patrons to ruin their day.\n3\tReturn to Jónar in Thorin's Hall\tJónar is in the cellar of Thorin's Hall. You should return to Jónar and tell him of all that transpired.\n",
[7721]="7006753C\n1\tRetrieve belongings from fallen hunters at Dor Pherkha\tIt might be worth reclaiming the fallen hunters' belongings and returning them to Kafagur.\n2\tFallen hunters can be found around Dor Pherkha. You should retrieve their belongings.\t\n3\tTalk to Rúkbag at Kafagur\tYou have retrieved a number of belongings from fallen hunters at Dor Pherkha. You should venture north-west to Kafagur and bring what you've collected to the hunter Rúkbag.\n",
[7722]="7004D371\n1\tDefeat Kalabrazân\tKalabrazân can be found patrolling the Dale-lands. You have encountered the sinister Kalabrazân. Roaming on the outskirts of the Dale-lands, the evil man works for unseen powers.\n2\tDefeat Kalabrazân\tKalabrazân can be found patrolling the Dale-lands. You have encountered the sinister Kalabrazân. Roaming on the outskirts of the Dale-lands, the evil man works for unseen powers.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated Kalabrazân.\n",
[7723]="70041D76\n1\tDefeat the sorcerer Kang-kethek quickly\tDefeat Kang-kethek quickly, before you and your allies succumb to his sorcery. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[7724]="700428C6\n1\tDefeat the sorcerer Kang-kethek quickly\tDefeat Kang-kethek quickly, before you and your allies succumb to his sorcery. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[7725]="7004D711\n1\tSearch Caras Tilion for signs of the Weeping Warrior\tCaras Tilion can be found to the south of Felegoth in Eryn Lasgalen. Unable to remember anything after encountering Karazgar, Thranduil has asked you to seek the Weeping Warrior in Caras Tilion.\n2\tFollow the trail of rust deeper into Caras Tilion\tThe trail of rust leads deeper into Caras Tilion. You should follow the trail of rust into Caras Tilion and attempt to learn what has transpired.\n3\tFollow the trail of rust deeper into Caras Tilion\tThe trail of rust leads deeper into Caras Tilion. You have found what remains of Thranduil's company and Karazgar's agents in Caras Tilion, but it appears Karazgar escaped this encounter. You should search for him deeper in Caras Tilion.\n4\tTalk to the Green Lady\tThe Green Lady is standing in the centre of Caras Tilion. You have followed Karazgar's trail to a rust-laden pool in Caras Tilion. The Green Lady that Thranduil described has revealed herself to you. You should attempt to speak to her and learn what has transpired.\n",
[7726]="7000D4EC\n1\tMinas Agar stands on the western side of Barad Gúlaran, south of Gath Forthnír. You must travel to Barad Gúlaran and defeat Karstíona, the emissary of the Trév Duvárdain, inside Minas Agar.\t\n2\tTalk to Brúnfair\tBrúnfair is in Gath Forthníir, north of Barad Gúlaran. Having defeated Karstíona, you should return to Brúnfair and tell him of your success.\n",
[7727]="7000A8D6\n1\tUse Fallen Ranger\tThe fallen Ranger carrying the map to Esteldín is somewhere within the pools and gardens of Glinghant, beyond the court of Clorhir, in Annúminas. Harthadril asked you to bring the map to Esteldín out of Glinghant.\n",
[7728]="7000B0FD\n1\tTalk to Taskmaster Sharkúlob at Gramsfoot and complete a patrol through the Ettenmoors as a Troll (Cost: 500 Commendations)\tTaskmaster Sharkúlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors. The trolls from Angmar, in an effort to speed the victory of Angmar's army, are willing to come to the Ettenmoors to fight the Free Peoples in exchange for your services in the North. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob.\n2\tTalk to Taskmaster Sharkúlob at Gramsfoot\tTaskmaster Sharkúlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors. You took the place of a troll in Angmar while it wrought destruction against the forces of the Free Peoples in the Ettenmoors. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob.\n",
[7729]="700544B4\n1\tTalk to Dolenthol in Barad Orhant\tDolenthol can be found in Barad Orhant. You should talk to Dolenthol.\n2\tTalk to Dolenthol in Barad Orhant\tDolenthol can be found in Barad Orhant. You should talk to Dolenthol.\n",
[7730]="7000C383\n1\tDeliver the keys to Oghûk in his cell within the Goblin-town prison\030Collect Plain Key (total: 12)\tGoblin-jailors can be found in the dungeons of Goblin-town. Oghûk believes that the jailors in the Goblin-town prison have the keys to his cell. He wants you to kill the jailors and find the keys. Only after you free him will he help you.\n",
[7731]="70002E43\n1\tCollect a token from the Hillmen of Rhudaur\tHillmen of Rhudaur may be found throughout the ruins of Nan Tornaeth, especially across the bridge of Thoriant. The Hillmen of Rhudaur have some foul connexion to the wights that stalk the ruins of Nan Tornaeth, and you should search among them for some token which might reveal their mutual master.\n2\tCollect a token from the Hillmen of Rhudaur\tHillmen of Rhudaur may be found throughout the ruins of Nan Tornaeth, especially across the bridge of Thoriant. The Hillmen of Rhudaur have some foul connexion to the wights that stalk the ruins of Nan Tornaeth, and you should search among them for some token which might reveal their mutual master.\n3\tYou found the emblem of the gaunt-man Gúrdring and should hunt for the evil creature before his power becomes too great.\t\n",
[7732]="7004AB99\n1\tDefeat those who occupy the first tower\030Seek out those who occupy the first tower\tWatch-towers can be found along the Ered Lithui. Seek out and defeat those who occupy the towers.\n2\tDefeat those who occupy the second tower\030Seek out those who occupy the second tower\tWatch towers can be found along the Ered Lithui. Seek out and defeat those who occupy the towers.\n3\tDefeat those who occupy the third tower\030Seek out those who occupy the third tower\tWatch towers can be found along the Ered Lithui. Seek out and defeat those who occupy the towers.\n",
[7733]="7005F6BE\n1\tPolish befouled crystal-lamps on the banks of Durthuzâram (total: 7)\tBefouled crystal-lamps can be found along the banks of Durthuzâram. After lending you his handkerchief, Hermáth Stormhammer has asked you to polish the befouled crystal-lamps along the banks of Durthuzâram.\n2\tTalk to Hermáth Stormhammer\tBefouled crystal-lamps can be found along the banks of Durthuzâram. After lending you his handkerchief, Hermáth Stormhammer has asked you to polish the befouled crystal-lamps along the banks of Durthuzâram.\n",
[7734]="70015E21\n1\tDefeat wood-trolls (total: 16)\tWood-trolls can be found near Sâd Thareg, south of Gwingris. Lithuilas has asked you to defeat the wood-trolls of Glâd Ereg and learn their purpose there. He suggests that you take an ally or two with you.\n2\tTalk to Lithuilas at Gwingris\tLithuilas is at Gwingris, north of Sâd Thareg. You should return to Lithuilas with word of your success.\n",
[7735]="70034AB0\n1\tSlain Orcs can be found to the south-east and south-west of the hidden cave in the Balewood. Bébba wants you to cut the clothing from Orcs slain by the nearby Wood-trolls in order to prevent her people from freezing in the cave.\t\n2\tTalk to Bébba\tBébba can be found in the hidden cave in southern Balewood. You have collected enough clothing for all of the refugees that remain in the cave in the Balewood. You should return to Bébba with what you have gathered so she may begin to tailor them.\n",
[7736]="7004A8EC\n1\tPatrol the Under-gate in the Tower of Cirith Ungol\tThe Under-gate can be found in the rear of the Tower of Cirith Ungol. Captain Róglarg has asked you to patrol the Under-gate and threaten the Uruk guards if they have been remiss in their duties.\n2\tShake your fist at the Under-gate wardens\tThe Under-gate wardens stand before the Under-gate in the Tower of Cirith Ungol. You have heard strange sounds on the other side of the Under-gate and should now threaten the Under-gate wardens as Captain Róglarg commanded.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have done your duty to Captain Róglarg and patrolled the Under-gate.\n",
[7737]="7002C5AF\n1\tDefeat trolls in the Limlight Gorge (total: 4)\tYou should gather your allies and defeat the monstrous trolls that inhabit the Limlight Gorge to prevent them from mustering numbers that might threaten Stangard.\n2\tTalk to Captain Agelbrit\tCaptain Agelbrit is at the Limlight Gorge guard-post. You should return to Captain Agelbrit with news of your success.\n",
[7738]="70047D7A\n1\tBlow Haerondir Horn at horn-blowing spots (total: 5)\tUse the Haerondir Horn at horn-blowing spots in Haerondir.\n2\tSpook curious Orc (quantity: see journal)\tCurious Orcs can be found outside of Haerondir. Use the Haerondir Horn to spook curious Orcs who have wandered too close to Haerondir.\n3\tSpeak with Rhadrog\tRhadrog can be found in Haerondir. You should speak with Rhadrog.\n",
[7739]="7005A30F\n1\tCollect cut wood (total: 8)\030Defeat Moria valley-stalkers (total: 8)\030Collect fallen branches (total: 10)\tWood for burning and valley-stalking Orcs can be found in the forests outside of Amdân. You should gather wood and defeat Moria valley-stalkers.\n2\tReturn to Dráttur\tDráttur is located in Amdân. Bring the wood to Dráttur.\n",
[7740]="700718A3\n1\tGather firewood (total: 8)\030Defeat Huorns (total: 5)\tBaráil in Sâr Marsag has asked you to travel west to Hadrudád and collect suitable firewood to keep their flame lit as well as defeat any of the monstrous huorns you encounter.\n2\tReturn to Baráil with the firewood\tReturn to Baráil in Sâr Marsag with the firewood you have collected to keep the flame lit.\n",
[7741]="7000EEDB\n1\tDefeat a Gauradan seer who is trying to ensorcel a mammoth\tSearch around Norsu-hauta for the Gauradan seer who is trying to ensorcel a mammoth.\n2\tTalk to Mika\tReturn to Mika in Norsu-hauta and tell him of your success.\n",
[7742]="70034C36\n1\tSpeak to Ansith\tAnsith is inside Gárferth's house, near the centre of Forlaw. Ansith and Ebba are preparing dinner after the long day.\n2\tRemove snow piles (total: 6)\tSnow piles on the western side of Forlaw are building up. Most of the residents cannot remember the snow in Forlaw ever being quite this bad.\n3\tSpeak to Cuthmar\tCuthmar can be found on the western side of Forlaw busy with his chores.\n4\tPick up fence posts (total: 6)\tFence posts can be found scattered around the western side of Forlaw.\n5\tCuthmar can be found on the western side of Forlaw busy with his chores.\t\n",
[7743]="7004CF35\n1\tPatrol the main road through Eryn Lasgalen for Orcs\tThe main road through Eryn Lasgalen can be found south of Felegoth. You should patrol the road for Orcs.\n2\tContinue to patrol the road through Eryn Lasgalen for Orcs\tThe road continues east and west. Continue patrolling for Orcs along the main road to the west.\n3\tContinue to patrol the road through Eryn Lasgalen for Orcs\tThe road continues to the west, towards the Vales of Anduin. Continue to patrol the main road to the west for Orcs.\n4\tTalk to Hállkell\tThe Beorning merchant can be found along the western end of the main road in Eryn Lasgalen. You should talk to the merchant and find out what happened to the caravan.\n5\tThe ambushed caravan can be found along the western end of the main road in Eryn Lasgalen. You should investigate the caravan.\t\n6\tTalk to Hállkell\tHállkell can be found along the western end of the main road in Eryn Lasgalen. You should talk to the merchant again.\n",
[7744]="7001A96F\n1\tObserve the race to see if Kolmar is victorious\tThe Keg-hopping Race begins soon on this very track. You have guessed that Kolmar will win the race, and you should observe whether or not this comes to pass.\n2\tTalk to Arnar\tArnar can be found in the Keg-race area during the Summer Festival. You should speak with Arnar and collect the bountiful prize he has to offer for your excellent luck.\n",
})
